{
  "id": "E223",
  "title": "The Boss's Treat",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-05-24",
  "synopsis": "What do you do if your boss wants to treat you to a meal?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/741/787151eaa37c5f55460eb21c591013917e7f6515.mp3?1527079120",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "当老板说请你吃饭\n\n王总：小张，这次的工作做得不错。\n小张：谢谢王总。\n王总：不过还有个问题我想跟你说一下。\n小张：您说。\n王总：不急，一会儿我请你吃饭吧，我们边吃边说。\n小张：不用不用，还是我请您吧。\n王总：别客气，你就当是工作餐吧，哈哈。\n小张：谢谢老板！",
    "traditional": "當老闆說請你吃飯\n\n王總：小張，這次的工作做得不錯。\n小張：謝謝王總。\n王總：不過還有個問題我想跟你說一下。\n小張：您說。\n王總：不急，一會兒我請你吃飯吧，我們邊吃邊說。\n小張：不用不用，還是我請您吧。\n王總：別客氣，你就當是工作餐吧，哈哈。\n小張：謝謝老闆！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When your boss wants to treat you to a meal"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王总：小张，这次的工作做得不错。",
      "traditional": "王總：小張，這次的工作做得不錯。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiǎo zhāng zhè cì de gōng zuò zuò de bú cuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little Zhang, you did a good job this time."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：谢谢王总。",
      "traditional": "小張：謝謝王總。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng xiè xie wáng zǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Thank you, Manager Wang."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王总：不过还有个问题我想跟你说一下。",
      "traditional": "王總：不過還有個問題我想跟你說一下。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng bú guò hái yǒu ge wèn tí wǒ xiǎng gēn nǐ shuō yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: But there is one problem I want to talk to you about."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：您说。",
      "traditional": "小張：您說。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng nín shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Please go ahead."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王总：不急，一会儿我请你吃饭吧，我们边吃边说。",
      "traditional": "王總：不急，一會兒我請你吃飯吧，我們邊吃邊說。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng bù jí yí huì'r wǒ qǐng nǐ chī fàn ba wǒ men biān chī biān shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: No hurry. I’ll treat you to a meal later, and we can talk about it while eating."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小张：不用不用，还是我请您吧。",
      "traditional": "小張：不用不用，還是我請您吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng bú yòng bú yòng hái shi wǒ qǐng nín ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: No need, let me treat you instead."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "王总：别客气，你就当是工作餐吧，哈哈。",
      "traditional": "王總：別客氣，你就當是工作餐吧，哈哈。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng bié kè qi nǐ jiù dāng shì gōng zuò cān ba hā hā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Don't be courteous. See it as a business meal, haha."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小张：谢谢老板！",
      "traditional": "小張：謝謝老闆！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng xiè xie lǎo bǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Thank you, boss!"
    }
  ],
